    15	`harness/web/voice.html` connects to OpenAI over WebRTC. xAI's realtime API is
    16	WebSocket-only (`wss://api.x.ai/v1/realtime?model=...`) with its own ephemeral-token
    17	endpoint. Task: (a) confirm from docs.x.ai the exact model id for voice 2.0, the
    18	ephemeral-token endpoint, function-tool support and a `tool_choice`-equivalent (the mouth
    19	MUST hand every utterance to `ask_chief`; if xAI can't force that, STOP and report);
    20	(b) a `/api/voice/token` that reads the mouth seat from `seats.toml` (provider →
    21	vendor, never hardcoded) and mints the right token; (c) a WebSocket audio path in
    22	voice.html (mic → PCM16 chunks → ws; audio deltas → playback; barge-in), keeping the
    23	existing `ask_chief` round-trip; (d) pin the exact model id, never `grok-voice-latest`.
