   129	`harness/tester.py` records a pytest log as artifact kind `trace` to satisfy
   130	`guard_tester_must_cite_artifacts` — that launders "the tests passed" into "someone
   131	drove the app", making a green suite sufficient to ship. Record test runs as `exit_code`
   132	+ `stdout` artifacts (kinds already in the schema), record NO tester verdict from a unit
   133	test log, and never run tests in a worktree whose diff contains anything but
