   539	# We serve the curated MEMORY.md index (the agents ⭐-mark what matters) and any one
   540	# named file from it. These are NOTES — conventions, rulings, architecture. A project's
   541	# live data (e.g. Arch's patient records) is not, and must never be, reachable here.
   542	# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   543	@app.get("/api/projects/{project_id}/memory")
