     1	# The Wall — three things only Neill can do (about an hour, once)
     2	
     3	The gatekeeper is a **door**: it checks the record before anything merges, deploys, or
     4	spends. But every agent still runs as *you*, on *your* account, with *your* keys — so a
     5	compromised or confused agent could walk around the door. These three steps are the
     6	wall. Nothing I build substitutes for them; each is enforced somewhere no agent can
